{
  "segment_count": 52,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 1.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:01.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:07.000",
      "text": "I hear that there's a Hawaiian custom of something called a hukilau."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.0,
      "end": 13.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:08.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:13.000",
      "text": "Hukilau, hukilau is they have a rope, end of the rope they have a net there."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 18.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:14.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:18.000",
      "text": "They surround that certain place and they drag the net."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.0,
      "end": 21.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:19.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:21.000",
      "text": "They surround it, you mean they carry the net out?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 22.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:21.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:22.000",
      "text": "Carry the net, uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 26.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:23.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:26.000",
      "text": "How do they, is there something to keep the net floating?"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 29.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:26.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:29.000",
      "text": "Yeah, some have those floaters floating."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 33.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:30.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:33.000",
      "text": "Some they lay down on the bottom and they drag that net in."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 37.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:34.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:37.000",
      "text": "What do the floats, what are the floats made of?"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:37.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:43.000",
      "text": "The float made of those, some coconut, dry coconut I guess."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:43.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:44.000",
      "text": "Oh, dry coconut."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 45.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:44.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:45.000",
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:45.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:46.000",
      "text": "That's a rooster coconut."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:47.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:49.000",
      "text": "And that floats the top of the net?"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 50.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:49.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:50.000",
      "text": "Top of the net."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:50.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:53.000",
      "text": "Now, the word lau means leaf, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 55.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:53.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:55.000",
      "text": "Lau, lau is a leaf."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 56.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:55.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:00:56.000",
      "text": "Yeah, lau is a leaf."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.0,
      "end": 60.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:00:56.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:00.000",
      "text": "All right, lau, the word is a leaf coming in this word."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 70.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:01.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:10.000",
      "text": "Hukilau, the leaves, you know, they sit on the top, top of the rope, so that when they pull, the fish are going to not jump over the rope."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 74.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:10.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:14.000",
      "text": "The ropes, the leaves keep the fish from jumping over?"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.0,
      "end": 75.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:14.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:15.000",
      "text": "They scare them away."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 78.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:15.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:18.000",
      "text": "They scare them away because they want to go under the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.0,
      "end": 83.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:18.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:23.000",
      "text": "The moment you go under the water, they will go to the net. They have a pocket on the net."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 85.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:23.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:25.000",
      "text": "They have a pocket on the net."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:25.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:27.000",
      "text": "Now the bottom of the net, that is..."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 89.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:27.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:29.000",
      "text": "The bottom of the net, they have a pocket."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:29.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:32.000",
      "text": "The bottom must have some kind of things to make it sink."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.0,
      "end": 94.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:32.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:34.000",
      "text": "Sink is a lid. They have a lid."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.0,
      "end": 96.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:34.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:36.000",
      "text": "Oh, they have a lid on it, I see."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.0,
      "end": 101.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:36.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:41.000",
      "text": "Then somebody goes out and puts the net out around."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:41.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:43.000",
      "text": "Yeah, they throw it with a boat."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 104.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:43.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:44.000",
      "text": "With a boat."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 108.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:44.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:48.000",
      "text": "Two boats, they throw it all around."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 110.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:48.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:50.000",
      "text": "And then who pulls it in?"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:50.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:57.000",
      "text": "Well, they have a lot of... on the shows, about 40, 50 guys, they pull that rope up."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 119.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:01:57.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:01:59.000",
      "text": "Ah, I see."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 123.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:00.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:03.000",
      "text": "But they must have a pretty big school of fish there."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.0,
      "end": 127.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:03.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:07.000",
      "text": "Yeah, once in a while they have a nice school, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.0,
      "end": 133.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:07.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:13.000",
      "text": "And then they pull them all in and the fish don't, are scared to jump out, so they get caught."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.0,
      "end": 137.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:13.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:17.000",
      "text": "No, they are all in a net already. They get caught in a net."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.0,
      "end": 144.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:17.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:24.000",
      "text": "I suppose the top of the net comes in sooner than the bottom, so if they do try to go out, they're not pocketed."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.0,
      "end": 151.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:24.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:31.000",
      "text": "Yeah, they have to take on, you know, about six or seven guys swimming around the net to watch how the fish are going."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.0,
      "end": 152.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:31.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:32.000",
      "text": "Oh, I see."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.0,
      "end": 154.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:32.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:34.000",
      "text": "And then chasing at the hole."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.0,
      "end": 155.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:34.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:35.000",
      "text": "Uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.0,
      "end": 161.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:36.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:41.000",
      "text": "Well, about how much fish do they get out of a good haul of those?"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.0,
      "end": 168.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:41.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:48.000",
      "text": "Once I saw up Waimea, they caught about a ton, I guess, of those akule."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.0,
      "end": 171.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:48.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:51.000",
      "text": "Oh, they have a nice crew up there."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.0,
      "end": 172.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:51.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:52.000",
      "text": "What's akule?"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.0,
      "end": 179.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:02:52.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:02:59.000",
      "text": "Um, the akule, some kind of, you know, the Hawaiian fish called akule, akule."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.0,
      "end": 182.0,
      "start_formatted": "00:03:00.000",
      "end_formatted": "00:03:02.000",
      "text": "http://www.hukilau.com"
    }
  ]
}